# Documentation toolchain source (MkDocs Material site published to Read the
# Docs). This file holds only the directly-declared docs dependencies; the
# consumed `docs/requirements.txt` is a fully hash-pinned resolution of this
# set. Regenerate after any change here with:
#
#   uv run --python 3.13 --with pip-tools -- \
#     pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file docs/requirements.txt \
#     docs/requirements.in
#
# The `imaging` extra pulls cairosvg/pillow for the Material `social` card
# plugin (mkdocs.yml); the matching native libs (libcairo, ...) are installed
# by `.readthedocs.yaml::build.apt_packages`.
